    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active Product2 records with SBQQ__ChargeType__c = &apos;Recurring&apos; but no SBQQ__BillingFrequency__c.
Why it matters: CPQ can&apos;t determine how often to bill — the subscription either fails to schedule or defaults to monthly when the customer expects annual. Invoice disputes follow on the first cycle.
Suppress a finding: when the frequency is intentionally derived from contract term at order time.
Disable the detector: only if your billing frequency lives in a custom field. Most CPQ+Billing orgs should leave this on.</value></values>
